      <enclosure url="https://static01.nyt.com/images/2026/11/24/multimedia/24Biz-nvidia-Trump-01-vqpj/24Biz-nvidia-Trump-01-vqpj-mediumSquareAt3X.jpg" length="0" type="image/jpeg" />
